# ============================================================
# AVI — REPO KHUSUS PROYEK APK (whitelist ketat)
# Keputusan Pak (tegaskan berkali-kali): isi repo FOKUS APK.
# Segala sesuatu di luar daftar di bawah adalah plumbing sandbox
# lokal (Next.js/bun, mockup, alat bantu, log) — DILARANG masuk GitHub.
# Pola /* memblokir SEMUA root file, lalu whitelist membuka yang sah.
# ============================================================

/*

# sah: proyek APK
!/android-app
!/android-app/**
!/build.gradle.kts
!/settings.gradle.kts
!/gradle.properties

# sah: CI build APK
!/.github
!/.github/workflows
# di dalam workflows: build-android.yml + deploy-preview.yml (Pages = gerbang desain)
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/build-android.yml
!/.github/workflows/deploy-preview.yml

# sah: preview desain AVI (keputusan Pak 10 Nov: Pages = gerbang persetujuan
# tampilan sebelum diimplementasikan jadi APK — avi-agent.html sah masuk repo)
!/public
!/public/avi-agent.html

# sah: dokumen & aturan repo
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
